# Pairs with NeverNotCommittedWhileLive. The reconciler records not committed
# for an unmoved anchor once the reconcile lease has passed, not the maximum
# pending age, while an accepted activation or a slow caller can still commit.
MODULE: AuditNotCommittedAtLease
TARGET: NeverNotCommittedWhileLive
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an unmoved anchor proves no commit as soon as the lease has passed
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
        verdict == CASE unmoved -> IF expired THEN "NotCommitted" ELSE "wait"
--- REPLACE
        verdict == CASE unmoved -> "NotCommitted"
--- END
